"That's {size} bytes, and Signal holds at most {limit}: letters such as å and "
"é take two each, emoji four."
msgstr ""
"Das sind {size} Bytes, und Signal fasst höchstens {limit}: Buchstaben wie ä "
"und é brauchen je zwei, Emoji vier."

